49
00:08:28,170 --> 00:08:28,990
Boring means safe.

50
00:08:29,530 --> 00:08:35,090
It means the focus stays on the content in the community, not on drama in the chat.

51
00:08:35,730 --> 00:08:41,110
Come consistent clear the three pillars of a healthy digital space.

52
00:08:41,890 --> 00:08:43,950
Now let's talk about your tools.

53
00:08:44,670 --> 00:08:48,350
These are the buttons you'll use to keep the chat running smoothly.

54
00:08:49,050 --> 00:08:52,630
