101
00:12:30,760 --> 00:12:34,460
Step 1 is almost always to delete the offending message.

102
00:12:35,300 --> 00:12:37,760
It's a clean, simple first action.

103
00:12:38,400 --> 00:12:42,680
If the behavior continues, you move to step two, time out.

104
00:12:43,220 --> 00:12:46,960
This gives the user a temporary break and a clear warning.

105
00:12:47,560 --> 00:12:53,000
If they return and continue to violate the rules, you move to step three, hide user.

106
00:12:53,620 --> 00:12:58,300
