113
00:13:24,550 --> 00:13:28,530
We are firm when we need to be, but we are never dramatic about it.

114
00:13:28,990 --> 00:13:32,950
Just as important as knowing what to do is knowing what not to do.

115
00:13:33,490 --> 00:13:34,770
