1481
02:08:20,160 --> 02:08:24,680
Your well-being is a priority. Healthy moderators make healthy chats.

1482
02:08:25,320 --> 02:08:33,200
So let's review our gold and standard. The goal of a cult of psyche moderator is to be firm, fair, and boring.

1483
02:08:33,710 --> 02:08:36,770
Our goal is not dominance, it is stability.

1484
