1485
02:08:41,710 --> 02:08:43,170
The conversations deepen.

1486
02:08:44,170 --> 02:08:47,230
Viewers feel safe enough to be vulnerable and share.

1487
02:08:48,090 --> 02:08:51,270
Trolls get bored and wander off to find easier targets.

1488
02:08:52,210 --> 02:08:55,410
And as a result, the show and the community grow.

